text = "Make sure to click the top!"
vertical_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3
script = ExtResource("4_oiqhk")
lines = Array[String](["Mining is simple in this game, simply tap the top of the block you wish to mine.

If you want to stop mining, tap it again.
Make sure to tap the top of the block, not the sides!", "Here is your mine settings, this is where you choose how you proceed deeper.

The first option means that you only go down when the center cube is mined, this is the default.

The second option means you will only proceed when you have mined every block, this is good for perfectionists.

the final option means you won't move down deeper and the blocks will simply regenerate.", "At the top menu is your dictionary/travel menu, it is very important!", "Here you can see every ore you have found, with information about their whereabouts.", "Some ores have rank requirements before they can be found. Getting xp and levelling up will allow you to find more ores!", "In the layers section, you will see information about all the layers in the game. 
More importantly, this allows you to fast travel to any layer in the game at any time.", "At the surface, there are various menus. At the forge you upgrade your pickaxes.
In storage, you free up your inventory by putting ores away.
In upgrades you use the points gained from levels to increase your strength.
", "In the forge, there are there are pickaxes that are forged, unlocked, or not unlocked. If you have forged a pickaxe you can equip it. If you have unlocked a pickaxe (which can be done through levelling up), you can view cost and stats.", "here are the stats of the pickaxe, these tell you their function below when you click on a new pickaxe.", "Here is the cost of the pickaxe, with the ores you will need. It doesn't matter if the ores are in your inventory or storage, so don't worry about it.", "Finally, I will tell you about depth, at the top of your screen your depth is displayed. the small number below it is your optimal depth, if you go past it your power will be severely reduced. Your optimal depth can be increased by pickaxes and upgrades."])
metadata/_edit_use_anchors_ = true

